      "sourceTextSha256": "0597c0a561a4c353baf5b163fc980202fdc5e0393bf2d797893649faadd6d214",
      "text": "Breakfast. A driver takes you to the airport for your flight to Cusco.\n\nOn arrival, meet your guide and travel to the Sacred Valley of the Incas. You'll spend your first night at a lower elevation to help you acclimatise.\n\nOn the way, visit **Awanakancha**, a rehabilitation centre for Andean animals. Here you can feed llamas, alpacas, guanacos and vicuñas. The next stop is Pisac Market, where vendors sell ceramics, rugs, souvenirs, silverware and leather goods.\n\nStay at **Belmond Rio Sagrado** in a **Deluxe Room**.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-mw9gatwi",
        "model": "ChatGPT Codex"
      }
